{"title":"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 50","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A club with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> members is organized into four committees in accordance with these two rules:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/7/347d52a0e5dbf85f7918ceb692326221dfa95609.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{(1)}\\ \\textup{Each member belongs to two and only two committees}\\qquad \\\\ \\text{(2)}\\ \\textup{Each pair of committees has one and only one member in common}\\]\" width=\"932\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/8/538efe4650bcf449f0e1b0bab81fc991d2ad5f0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} \\ \\textup{cannot be determined} \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(B)} \\ \\textup{has a single value between 8 and 16} \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(C)} \\ \\textup{has two values between 8 and 16} \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)} \\ \\textup{has a single value between 4 and 8} \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(E)} \\ \\textup{has two values between 4 and 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"293\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can label each of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> members with the pair of committees that they belong to, which is clearly valid due to rule (1). Then, by rule (2), for each pair of committees, there is exactly one member labeled with that pair. But since we have four committees, there must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/e/5fea3bb0a81211a24d27ff50cca0d686c134d2b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\binom{4}{2} = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"104\" height=\"53\" /> members in total. Thusly our choice is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />, and we are done.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME\" title=\"1959 AHSME\">1959 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1959 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1959\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 49\">Problem 49</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\"